---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout lang="en" title="Home">
  <div class="space-y-16">
    <section class="text-left">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-900 mb-4">Olineri - An Introduction</h2>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
        In the name of devotion, crowds have surged in temples today. Similarly, in the name of wisdom, ashrams are overflowing with people. Yet, human society is losing its humanity and living without clarity. Despite accepting and gaining understanding through teachings, books, spiritual masters, discourses, and meditation techniques, humanity suffers, unable to practice them and live a fulfilling life. <b>Olineri</b> is the way of life that prompts an individual to investigate the root cause within themselves, transforming a human into a great being and turning them into a divine field where the Almighty manifests.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="text-left">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-900 mb-4">Paths to Realize Olineri</h2>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
        The Primordial (Adhi) Maha Yogi, the Supreme Guru of the ancient Gurukula tradition, sowed the secrets of Universal Supreme Truths in five places.
      </p>
      <ol class="list-decimal list-inside text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 space-y-2 mt-4">
          <li>He concealed them within divine forms of temple and in the related ritualistic worship practices.</li>
          <li>He sowed them within language—seeding intellectual explanations in Tamil and vibrational/movement explanations in Sanskrit.</li>
          <li>He embedded these Supreme Truths within the way of life (culture) that humans ought to lead.</li>
          <li>He reveals these truths by manifesting as the Initiating Guru (Upadesa Guru) in ancient Gurukula classes.</li>
          <li>For those who have attained maturity in their inward journey, He continues these teachings in the form of intuition.</li>
      </ol>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
        Vallalar Adhiyinam is the organization dedicated to revealing these rare teachings to humanity, which were attained by striving through these five paths established by the Primordial (Aadhi) Maha Yogi.
      </p>
    </section>
    
  </div>
</BaseLayout>